these developers continue to systematically dismantle the infrastructure that I built over many years for Sage packaging and modularization. I can provide a list with details of previous such acts of vandalism that have already been merged.

These disrespectful activities are unprecedented in the Sage project, where the community's tradition is to preserve even minute details of code over decades.

@vbraun Given that there is no meaningful governance structure in the Sage project left, I hold you personally responsible for the merging of such vandalism.

